{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_26922","headline":"西掖寓直春晓闻残漏 · 姚合","name":"西掖寓直春晓闻残漏","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"直庐仙掖近，春气曙犹寒。\n隐隐银河在，丁丁玉漏残。\n微风飘更切，万籁杂应难。\n凤阁明初啓，鸡人唱渐阑。\n静宜来禁里，清是下云端。\n我识朝天路，从容自整冠。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"姚合","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_26922.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_26922","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}